-- load-bearing: Roblox leaves an AnimationTrack in the Animator's active list AFTER it stops, so
-- "the swing animation is present" does NOT mean "they are swinging". Measured live on two enemies:
--   playing swing -> TimePosition advancing, 220=1.000, 224=1.000
--   finished swing -> TimePosition frozen,   220=0.000, 224=0.000   (lingered for 21-25 SECONDS)
